---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  lang="en" 
  title="NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Chapter Officially Established! Ashley Qi Appointed President | NACUAA WA" 
  description="On September 17, 2026, the North America Chinese University Alumni Alliance Washington State (Seattle) Chapter was officially established, with Ashley Qi serving as its inaugural president. Serving alumni across Washington State and Greater Seattle." 
  path="/en/posts/2026-09-17-nacuaa-washington-state-chapter-established/"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to News & Events</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">
          <time datetime="2026-09-17">September 17, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">Major Announcement</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight heading-font">
          🎉 NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Chapter Officially Established!
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-base">
          Rooted in Greater Seattle and Serving Washington State · Ashley Qi (戚霄) Appointed President
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- President Card -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/40 via-slate-900 to-slate-900 border border-blue-800/40 rounded-3xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-6 shadow-xl">
        <img 
          src="/images/ashley.jpg" 
          alt="Ashley Qi (戚霄) - President of NACUAA Washington State Chapter" 
          class="w-28 h-28 rounded-2xl object-cover border-2 border-blue-500/50 shadow-lg shrink-0" 
        />
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center sm:text-left">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 text-xs font-semibold border border-blue-500/20">
            Chapter President
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Ashley Qi (戚霄)</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            President, NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Chapter.<br />
            Dedicated to uniting collegiate alumni across Greater Seattle and Washington State into an open, dynamic platform for collaboration and mutual growth.
          </p>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 pt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 justify-center sm:justify-start">
            <span><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope mr-1 text-blue-400"></i> ashley@nacuaa.ai</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-globe mr-1 text-blue-400"></i> wa.nacuaa.ai</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Content Body -->
      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          Dear Alumni and Friends in Washington State and Greater Seattle:
        </p>

        <p>
          On September 17, 2026, the <strong>North America Chinese University Alumni Alliance Washington State (Seattle) Chapter</strong> (abbreviated as <strong>NACUAA WA</strong>) was officially established!
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-950/30 border border-blue-800/30 text-slate-300 text-sm space-y-2">
          <p class="font-semibold text-blue-400">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1"></i> Geographic Distinction: Washington State vs. Washington D.C.
          </p>
          <p>
            NACUAA Washington State Chapter is rooted in the <strong>State of Washington (Pacific Northwest)</strong>, centered around the <strong>Greater Seattle Metropolitan Area</strong> (including Seattle, Bellevue, Redmond, Kirkland, Tacoma, etc.). NACUAA Washington State Chapter (<code>wa.nacuaa.ai</code>) is distinct from the East Coast <strong>Greater Washington D.C. Chapter</strong> (<code>dc.nacuaa.ai</code>), serving as two distinct sister chapters collaborating across North America.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">
          🌲 Hub for Innovation and Community in the Pacific Northwest
        </h3>
        <p>
          The Greater Seattle region is home to tens of thousands of accomplished collegiate alumni working across major technology hubs (Microsoft, Amazon, and leading AI startups), research institutes, and universities. The establishment of the Washington State Chapter establishes a permanent hub to foster professional excellence, alumni mutual aid, and community vitality.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">
          🚀 Launching Nine Signature Clubs
        </h3>
        <p>
          To enrich our community's athletic, cultural, and intellectual pursuits, NACUAA WA has launched nine signature clubs accessible via direct URI paths:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
          <a href="/en/guandan/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-blue-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">🎴 Guandan Card Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Strategic card tournaments, friendly games, and social matchmaking</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-blue-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/guandan</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/hike/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">🥾 Rainier Hiking Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Exploring Mount Rainier, the Cascades, and PNW national trails</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/hike</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/pickleball/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">🏓 Pickleball Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Weekend open plays, beginner clinics, and tournaments</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/pickleball</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/golf/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-emerald-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">⛳ Green Golf Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Scrambles and social rounds across premier PNW courses</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/golf</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/tennis/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-lime-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-lime-400 transition-colors">🎾 Excellence Tennis Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Singles & doubles ladders, drills, and friendly matches</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-lime-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/tennis</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/music/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-pink-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors">🎵 Music Club / VI AI Music</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">AI songwriting, vocal jam sessions, and recitals</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-pink-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/music</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/garden/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">🌱 Green Home Gardening Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Organic gardening, fruit tree care, plant & seedling swaps</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-teal-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/garden</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/ai/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">🤖 AI Venture Club</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">AI agents, startup mentorship, and tech seminars</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-purple-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/ai</div>
          </a>

          <a href="/en/aimedia/" class="p-4 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/40 rounded-2xl transition-all group block sm:col-span-2">
            <div class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">🎬 AI Media & Video Studio</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Generative video, digital avatars, and multimedia storytelling</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-indigo-400 font-mono mt-2">wa.nacuaa.ai/aimedia</div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-3">
          🤝 Continental Sister Chapters Network
        </h3>
        <p>
          NACUAA Washington State Chapter collaborates closely with our sister chapters:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-300 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Northern California Chapter</strong> (<a href="https://norcal.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">norcal.nacuaa.ai</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>Silicon Valley Chapter</strong> (<a href="https://sv.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">sv.nacuaa.ai</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>North Carolina Chapter</strong> (<a href="https://nc.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">nc.nacuaa.ai</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>Greater Washington D.C. Chapter</strong> (<a href="https://dc.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">dc.nacuaa.ai</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>Southern California Chapter</strong> (<a href="https://sc.nacuaa.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">sc.nacuaa.ai</a>)</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- WeChat QR Join Section -->
        <div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl text-center space-y-4">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Join the NACUAA Washington State Community</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-md mx-auto">
            Scan below to join the official NACUAA Washington State (Seattle) Welcome WeChat Group:
          </p>
          <div class="inline-block p-2 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
            <img 
              src="/images/wechat_group_qr_wa.jpg" 
              alt="NACUAA Washington State Seattle WeChat Group QR Code" 
              class="w-60 h-60 object-contain rounded-xl"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            Official Inquiries: <a href="mailto:ashley@nacuaa.ai" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">ashley@nacuaa.ai</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
